    title: "Israeli forces kill 15-year-old boy in Gaza",
    summary: "Israeli forces kill 15-year-old boy in Gaza Israeli forces killed a 15-year-old Palestinian boy in al-Mawasi, west of Khan Younis in southern Gaza, on Friday, the Palestinian news agency Wafa reported. Mohammed Nidal Barbakh was shot in al-Mawasi and later succumbed to his injuries, medical sources said. At least 1,602 Palestinians have been killed and 5,799 wounded in Israeli attacks since the ceasefire took effect on 11 October 2025, according to Gaza’s health ministry. The overall death toll since the war began on 7 October 2023 has risen to 74,618, with 175,925 wounded. 15-year-old Palestinian boy Mohammed Nedal Barbakh was just shot and killed by Israeli occupation forces in al-Mawasi, Khan Younis, southern Gaza. An Israeli sniper shot him in the neck. Israel continues its genocide with complete impunity. https://t.co/TPJFluf0lX — Sarah Ali (@Saritah_91) November 6, 2026",
